helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hy	$[officename] Impress Features				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146119				0	hy	\<variable id=\"main0503\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/main0503.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] Impress Features\"\>$[officename] Impress Features\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3151074				0	hy	$[officename] Impress lets you create professional slide shows that can include charts, drawing objects, text, multimedia and a variety of other items. If you want, you can even import and modify Microsoft PowerPoint presentations.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3149379				0	hy	For on-screen slide shows, animation, slide transitions and multimedia are a few of the techniques you can use to make your presentation more exciting.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154016				0	hy	Creating Vector Graphics				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3154485				0	hy	Many of the tools for creating vector graphics in $[officename] Draw are available in $[officename] Impress.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150208				0	hy	Creating Slides				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3153247				0	hy	$[officename] Impress provides you with templates to create professional-looking slides.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3148610	14			0	hy	You can also assign a number of  dynamic effects to your slides, including animation and transition  effects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153820				0	hy	Creating Presentations				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3153917				0	hy	Several views or pages are available when you design a slide show. For example, the Slide Sorter displays an overview of your slides in thumbnail form, while the Handout page contains both the slide and the text you want to distribute to the audience.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3148608				0	hy	$[officename] Impress also lets you rehearse the timing of your slide show.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154649				0	hy	Publishing Presentations				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3150046				0	hy	You can publish your slides on-screen, as handouts, or as HTML documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146965				0	hy	Giving Presentations				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3145114				0	hy	$[officename] Impress gives you the choice of running a slide show automatically or manually.				20200411 15:09:53
