helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	hy	Under Windows only, you can view any $[officename] document in a window of the Microsoft Internet Explorer. Install the ActiveX control in the $[officename] Setup program.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156346				0	hy	Installing the ActiveX control				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3153821				0	hy	Close $[officename] and the Quickstarter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	hy	Click the Start button on the Windows taskbar. Choose \<emph\>Control Panel\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E8				0	hy	In the Control Panel, click \<emph\>Add or Remove Programs\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3156155				0	hy	In the list, click %PRODUCTNAME, then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_idN10706				0	hy	In the Installation Wizard, select \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
