helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	hy	In Internet Explorer, browse to a web page that contains a link to a $[officename] Writer document, for example.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	hy	Click the link to view the document in the Internet Explorer window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3154072				0	hy	You may still right-click the link to save the file on your harddisk.				20200411 15:09:53
