helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\textmode_change.xhp	0	help	par_id3159157				0	hy	On the Status Bar, click on the area indicating the current mode in order to switch to the other mode:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\textmode_change.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673				0	hy	\<emph\>INSRT\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\textmode_change.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307	7			0	hy	Insert mode is enabled. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>The text cursor is a blinking vertical line. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>Click on the area to enable the overwrite mode.				20200411 15:09:53
