helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154272				0	hy	Selecting a language for a Character Style				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3145649				0	hy	Open the Styles and Formatting window and click on the \<emph\>Character Styles\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
