helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	hy	There are many options for moving or copying objects using drag-and-drop. Text sections, drawing objects, graphics, form controls, hyperlinks, cell ranges, and many more can be moved or copied with the mouse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	hy	Note that the mouse pointer displays a plus sign when copying and an arrow when creating a link or hyperlink.				20200411 15:09:53
