helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	hy	Choose \<emph\>Protect Records\</emph\>. This opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/password_dlg.xhp\" name=\"Password\"\>\<emph\>Password\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
