helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146135				0	hy	Microsoft PowerPoint adds the bottom spacing of a paragraph to the top spacing of the next paragraph to calculate the total spacing between both paragraphs. $[officename] Impress utilizes only the larger of the two spacings.				20200411 15:09:53
