helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155306				0	hy	If \<emph\>Number recognition\</emph\> is not marked, numbers are saved in text format and are automatically left-aligned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155856				0	hy	Number format recognition				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159346	43			0	hy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_NUMFMT_FORMATTING\"\>If\<emph\> Number format recognition \</emph\>is not marked, only input in the format that has been set at the cell is accepted. Any other input resets the format to \<emph\>Text\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153876				0	hy	Alignment				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149379				0	hy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_NUMALIGNMENT\"\>Specifies that numbers are always bottom right aligned in the cell.\</ahelp\> If this field is not marked numbers are always top left aligned in the cell.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146792				0	hy	Direct formatting is not influenced by the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> field. If you center align the cell contents directly, they remain centered irrespective of whether text or numbers are involved.				20200411 15:09:53
