helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153662				0	hy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTIONS_SEARCH\"\>Use this tab page to define the settings for searching in the Internet.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
