helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798				0	hy	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SFXPAGE_SAVE_BTN_DOCINFO\"\>Specifies that the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog will appear every time you select the \<emph\>Save As\</emph\> command.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145606				0	hy	Always create backup copy				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123				0	hy	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SFXPAGE_SAVE_BTN_BACKUP\"\>Saves the previous version of a document as a backup copy whenever you save a document. Every time \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> creates a backup copy, the previous backup copy is replaced. The backup copy gets the extension .BAK.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	hy	To change the location of the backup copy, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Paths\</emph\>, and then enter a new path for the backup file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154908				0	hy	Save AutoRecovery information every				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149560				0	hy	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SFXPAGE_SAVE_BTN_AUTOSAVE\"\>Specifies that \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> saves the information needed to restore all open documents in case of a crash. You can specify the saving time interval.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146147				0	hy	Minutes				20200411 15:09:53
