helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	hy	You can also use placeholders for the names of hosts and domains. For example, type *.sun.com to address all the hosts in the sun.com domain without proxy.				20200411 15:09:53
