helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154729				0	hy	Print layout				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145254				0	hy	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If you mark this field, the print layout of the current document is exported as well.\</ahelp\> It can be read by $[officename], Netscape Navigator, and MS Internet Explorer.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156276				0	hy	The HTML filter supports CSS2 (Cascading Style Sheets Level 2) for printing documents. These capabilities are only effective if print layout export is activated.				20200411 15:09:53
