helpcontent2	source\text\smath\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148870				0	hy	Shortcut Keys for Formula Functions				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153246	19			0	hy	The following shortcut keys correspond to commands in the \<emph\>Edit\</emph\> and \<emph\>View \</emph\>menus.				20200411 15:09:53
