helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147341				0	hy	\<variable id=\"main\"\>\<link href=\"text/smath/guide/main.xhp\" name=\"Instructions for Using $[officename] Math\"\>Instructions for Using $[officename] Math\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
