helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153918				0	hy	If the transformation fails, nothing is inserted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153919				0	hy	This command handles only MathML content. If you have copied a %PRODUCTNAME Math formula to clipboard, insert it using the command \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02060000.xhp\" name=\"Paste\"\>Paste\</link\> under \<emph\>Edit\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
