helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145799				0	hy	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_PREVERR\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Moves the cursor to the previous error (moving left).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
