helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3155394	48			0	hy	For alignment, the \<emph\>alignl, alignc\</emph\> and \<emph\>alignr\</emph\> commands are especially effective, if you are 				20200411 15:09:53
