helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153006				0	hy	Draws a line that ends in a rectangular callout from where you drag in the current document. The text direction is horizontal. Drag a handle of the callout to resize the callout. To change a rectangular callout to a rounded callout, drag the largest corner handle when the pointer changes to a hand. To add text, click the edge of the callout, and then type or paste your text.				20200411 15:09:53
