helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145348				0	hy	Select \<emph\>Color\</emph\>, and then click a color in the list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150934				0	hy	To add some hot spots that call other slides:				20200411 15:09:53
