helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_idN10898				0	hy	Select the object, then choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Interaction\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_idN108A0				0	hy	Select an interaction in the dialog. For example, select to go to the next slide when the user clicks the object.				20200411 15:09:53
