helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\move_object.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146121				0	hy	\<bookmark_value\>objects;moving in slides\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>moving;objects in slides\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\move_object.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146121				0	hy	\<variable id=\"move_object\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/move_object.xhp\" name=\"Moving Objects\"\>Moving Objects\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\move_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149667				0	hy	You can move selected objects in your slide by dragging them, using the arrow keys, or by copying the objects and pasting them in another location.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\move_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3145799				0	hy	The arrow keys let you move objects more precisely than with the mouse.				20200411 15:09:53
