helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145800				0	hy	Snap Point/Line				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150752				0	hy	\<variable id=\"fangtext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CapturePoint\"\>Inserts a snap point or snap line (also known as guide) that you can use to quickly align objects.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Snap points and snap lines do not appear in printed output.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145388				0	hy	You can drag a snap line from the rulers and drop them on the page. To delete a snap line, drag it back to the ruler.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153815				0	hy	Draw or move an object near a snap point or snap line to snap it in place.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157978				0	hy	To set the snap range, choose \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070300.xhp\" name=\"Drawing - Grid\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Draw - Grid\</emph\>\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070300.xhp\" name=\"Presentation - Grid\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Impress - Grid\</emph\>\</link\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> in the Options dialog box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147402				0	hy	Position				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150533	6			0	hy	Sets the position of a selected snap point or line relative to the top left corner of the page. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153040				0	hy	You can also drag a snap point or snap line to a new position.				20200411 15:09:53
