helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149263				0	hy	\<bookmark_value\>conditional formatting; cells\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cells; conditional formatting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formatting; conditional formatting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>styles;conditional styles\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cell formats; conditional\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>random numbers;examples\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cell styles; copying\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>copying; cell styles\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables; copying cell styles\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
