helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150491				0	hy	Spacing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156097				0	hy	The spacing section is used to determine the horizontal and vertical distances between the reduced document pages on one page.				20200411 15:09:53
