helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154420				0	hy	In your text document, do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153383				0	hy	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste\</emph\>. The cell range is pasted as an OLE object. To edit the contents of the cells, double-click the object.				20200411 15:09:53
