helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3156097				0	hy	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153402				0	hy	Click the icon of the style category that you want to create.				20200411 15:09:53
