helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153138				0	hy	Click the arrow next to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Style from Selection\</item\> icon and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Style from Selection\</item\> from the submenu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3156260				0	hy	Type a name in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style Name\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
