helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151196				0	hy	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151220				0	hy	Click the \<emph\>Localized Options\</emph\> tab				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151245				0	hy	Clear the "Replace" check box(es).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155076				0	hy	To Stop Capitalizing the First Letter of a Sentence				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155099	10			0	hy	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools – AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155123				0	hy	Click the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155148				0	hy	Clear the "Capitalize first letter of every sentence" check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155401				0	hy	To Stop Drawing a Line When You Type Three Identical Characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155415				0	hy	$[officename] automatically draws a line when you type three of the following characters and press Enter: - _ = * ~ #				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155439				0	hy	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
