helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154897				0	hy	\<variable id=\"navigator\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/navigator.xhp\" name=\"Navigator for Text Documents\"\>Navigator for Text Documents\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3153402				0	hy	The Navigator displays the different parts of your document, such as headings, tables, frames, objects, or hyperlinks.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3154247				0	hy	To open the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>, press F5.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3155878				0	hy	To quickly jump to a location in your document, double-click an item listed in the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\> window or enter the respective page number in the spin box.				20200411 15:09:53
