helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3150502				0	hy	To create a form letter, you need a text document that contains fields for address data, and an address database. Then you combine or merge the address data and the text document to either print the letters or send them by e-mail.				20200411 15:09:53
