helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_nextpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147109				0	hy	Place the cursor in the footer and choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_nextpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147134				0	hy	In the \<emph\>Fields\</emph\> dialog, click the \<emph\>Document\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
