helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_nextpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150517				0	hy	Click a numbering style in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_nextpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537				0	hy	If you select 'Text' in the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> list, only the text that you enter in the \<emph\>Value\</emph\> box is displayed in the field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_nextpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150727				0	hy	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> to insert the field with the page number.				20200411 15:09:53
