helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1087E				0	hy	Before you begin, ensure that you have created a page style that uses a page background. See \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/pagebackground.xhp#define\"\>To Change the Page Background\</link\> for details.				20200411 15:09:53
