helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1089A				0	hy	Click the \<emph\>Page Styles\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108A2				0	hy	Double-click the page style that uses the page background that you want to apply.				20200411 15:09:53
