helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155870				0	hy	To Create a Numbered List From Non-consecutive Paragraphs:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3153417				0	hy	Hold down Ctrl and drag a selection in the first numbered paragraph. You only have to select one character.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3149644				0	hy	Continue to hold down Ctrl, and drag a selection in each numbered paragraph of the lists you want to combine.				20200411 15:09:53
