helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3148691	22			0	hy	Enter the number you want the list to start with in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Start \</item\>               \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>at\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
