helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147653				0	hy	To Apply a Background To Text Characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150669				0	hy	Select the characters.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3155390				0	hy	Choose \<emph\>Format - Character\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	hy	Click the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab, select the background color.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153541				0	hy	To Apply a Background To a Paragraph				20200411 15:09:53
