helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150565				0	hy	\<variable id=\"eintrag\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertIndexesEntry\"\>Marks the selected text as index or table of contents entry.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	hy	To edit an index entry, place the cursor in front of the index field, and then choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02160000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Index Entry\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Index Entry\</emph\>\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145760				0	hy	You can leave the \<emph\>Insert Index Entry\</emph\> dialog open while you select and insert entries.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145410				0	hy	Selection				20200411 15:09:53
