helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154656				0	hy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:UpdateFields\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Updates the contents of all fields in the current document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
