helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151262				0	hy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_FRM_STD:CB_AUTOHEIGHT\"\>Automatically adjusts the width or height of a frame to match the contents of the frame. If you want, you can specify a minimum width or minimum height for the frame.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152773				0	hy	The \<emph\>Automatic\</emph\> option is only available when you select a frame.				20200411 15:09:53
