helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148933	74			0	hy	To quickly move the cursor to another page while you are in a document, press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F5, type the number of the page that you want to jump to, and then wait a few moments.				20200411 15:09:53
