helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id1209200804371097				0	hy	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Assigns an outline level from 1 to 10 to the selected paragraphs or Paragraph Style.\</ahelp\> Select \<emph\>Body text\</emph\> to reset the outline level.				20200411 15:09:53
