helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156124				0	hy	Displays the condition that must be met for the field to be activated. If you want, you can enter a new \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>condition\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
